The '''Path of Apmeken''' in [[Tombs of Amascut]] leads to [[Ba-Ba]], the guardian of [[Apmeken]]. If another path has been entered, Ba-Ba's head is removed to show that another path is currently being attempted. After the path of Apmeken is cleared, the fire disappears.

